meta {
  name: GPS delete - PERMANENT, run delete-preview first
  type: http
  seq: 48
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/gps
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  deviceId: 08:D1:F9:C8:4D:24
  start: 2026-10-10T15:00:00.000Z
  end: 2026-10-10T23:30:00.000Z
}

docs {
  THE REAL DELETE. Permanent, no undo.

  Check delete-preview.bru first and confirm its count matches what you
  intend to remove. That preview is what the map's Clean panel shows in
  its confirm dialog.

  Expect 200: { deleted: <n> } — equal to the preview count.
  Expect 403: ENABLE_GPS_EDIT not set on the target server.

  Reminder: local :3000 shares the LIVE Turso DB, so this deletes
  production data. Only the Turso-backed rows go; the ephemeral sim slot
  has no history and cannot be deleted.
}
